WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.180
Some books have happy stories.

2
00:00:04.181 --> 00:00:08.725
Happy stories make me smile.

3
00:00:08.726 --> 00:00:12.765
Some books have scary stories.

4
00:00:12.766 --> 00:00:18.719
Scary stories make me afraid.

5
00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:21.769
Some books have adventure stories.

6
00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:27.424
Adventure stories make me excited.

7
00:00:27.425 --> 00:00:30.090
Some books have information.

8
00:00:30.091 --> 00:00:34.793
Schoolbooks make me smart.

9
00:00:34.794 --> 00:00:38.375
Some books have comics.

10
00:00:38.376 --> 00:00:42.571
Comic books make me laugh.

11
00:00:42.572 --> 00:00:44.994
Some books have recipes.

12
00:00:44.995 --> 00:00:50.061
Cookbooks make me hungry.

13
00:00:50.062 --> 00:00:52.828
Some books have sad stories.

14
00:00:52.829 --> 00:00:59.213
Sad stories make me cry.

15
00:00:59.214 --> 00:01:02.420
Reading is fun.

16
00:01:02.421 --> 00:01:07.328
Books are my friends!

